config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_EMMETI_EQ2021
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Emmeti EQ2021 thermostat (Modbus)"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYSERIAL
	default n
	help
		control of the Emmeti EQ2021 thermostats over Modbus (it ships its own copy of minimalmodbus and uses pyserial for the RS-485 port).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/domoticz-emmeti-eq2021, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> Emmeti EQ2021, enter the serial port and the Modbus address.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
